title: "A strictly additive projective two-weight code of length 66"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "Answers both questions in Kurz Remark 18 by partitioning a specified 198-point binary projective set into 66 lines and constructing a strictly additive projective quaternary code of length 66, dimension 5 in quaternary notation, and nonzero weights 48 and 56."
